### Assign an existing agent to an existing shipment
POST http://localhost:8084/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shipmentId": 1,
  "agentId": 4
}

### Assign the first available agent automatically
POST http://localhost:8084/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shipmentId": 1
}

### Get a delivery by id
GET http://localhost:8084/deliveries/1

### Progress a delivery and update the linked shipment
PATCH http://localhost:8084/deliveries/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Complete a delivery and update the linked shipment
PATCH http://localhost:8084/deliveries/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### Assign a delivery through API Gateway discovery routing
POST http://localhost:8080/DELIVERY-SERVICE/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shipmentId": 1,
  "agentId": 2
}